      "content": "Clearing the debt before the read completes loses the retry if the user leaves the card while the request is pending: the unmount cleanup sees `false`, and a later failure only updates the ref of an already-unmounted form. Likewise, dismissing a partial-sale receipt before its initial read fails skips the dismissal retry. Keep track of the outstanding read/debt until success and arrange a retry when dismissal or leaving occurs during a read that subsequently fails. The new tests use immediately resolved promises, so they do not cover these pending-request cases.",
